\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces {\bf  Left:} Test error as a function of model size and train epochs. The horizontal line corresponds to model-wise double descent--varying model size while training for as long as possible. The vertical line corresponds to epoch-wise double descent, with test error undergoing double-descent as train time increases. {\bf  Right} Train error of the corresponding models. All models are Resnet18s trained on CIFAR-10 with 15\% label noise, data-augmentation, and Adam for up to 4K epochs. Reused from \cite  {nakkiran_deep_2019}}}{6}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:unified}{{3}{6}{{\bf Left:} Test error as a function of model size and train epochs. The horizontal line corresponds to model-wise double descent--varying model size while training for as long as possible. The vertical line corresponds to epoch-wise double descent, with test error undergoing double-descent as train time increases. {\bf Right} Train error of the corresponding models. All models are Resnet18s trained on CIFAR-10 with 15\% label noise, data-augmentation, and Adam for up to 4K epochs. Reused from \cite {nakkiran_deep_2019}}{figure.caption.3}{}}
